===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Growlithe|32}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Dig Claws''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Growlithe|89}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

